## Command

```shell
biome format --write '<TEMP_DIR>/processes_paths_outside_the_vcs_root/engine/../outside/file.js'
```

## `engine/biome.json`

```json
{
  "vcs": {
    "enabled": true,
    "clientKind": "git",
    "useIgnoreFile": true,
    "root": "."
  }
}
```

